// --- verbatim |{ ... }|: delimiters scoped; interior UNPAINTED (the foo{x} inside is NOT a tag) ---
A @code|{ raw @foo{x} here }| end
//^ punctuation.definition.tag.nota
// ^^^^ entity.name.tag.html.nota
//     ^^ punctuation.definition.verbatim.begin.nota
//       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.nota - entity.name.tag.html.nota
